---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EntityArticle from '../../components/v2/templates/EntityArticle.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../../utils/seo';
const pageSEO = getPageSEO('equipment-chiller');
---

<BaseLayout pageId="equipment-chiller" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }, { label: pageSEO.h1 }]}>
<EntityArticle
  title={pageSEO.h1}
  kicker="Equipment profile"
  intro="Chiller is a name reported in Karinderya update coverage, but its current function and availability are not yet established by reliable evidence."
  heroImage={siteImages.equipmentHero}
  tableOfContents
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Equipment Hub', href: '/equipment/', description: 'Browse restaurant equipment categories and usage guidance.' },
    { label: 'Cooking and Serving Guide', href: '/guides/cooking-and-serving/', description: 'Follow the restaurant workflow from preparation through customer service.' },
    { label: 'Restaurant Layout Guide', href: '/guides/restaurant-layout/', description: 'Plan clear work areas and movement routes around the restaurant.' },
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Learn the main restaurant systems and how they connect.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="direct-answer">Direct Answer</h2>
  <p>Community update records associate a feature named <strong>Chiller</strong> with Karinderya. The material reviewed for this rebuild does not establish its current location, acquisition method, or gameplay function.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>This URL is retained as an Equipment entry so confirmed Chiller information has a stable destination. It remains separate from the Stove directory because no reliable evidence reviewed here identifies it as a Stove.</p>

  <h2 id="what-is-confirmed">What Is Confirmed</h2>
  <p>The Chiller name appears in dated community coverage of Karinderya. No creator-owned patch note or current in-game capture reviewed for this page confirms more detailed behavior.</p>

  <h2 id="what-is-unconfirmed">What Is Not Yet Confirmed</h2>
  <ul><li>Its exact current in-game name and location.</li><li>How it is obtained.</li><li>Whether it stores ingredients, affects food, or performs another task.</li><li>Any price, repair requirement, capacity, speed, or performance effect.</li></ul>

  <h2 id="related-systems">Related Systems</h2>
  <p>Use the <a href="/equipment/">Equipment Hub</a> for confirmed restaurant tools. The <a href="/ingredients/">Ingredients</a>, <a href="/food/">Food</a>, and <a href="/guides/cooking-and-serving/">Cooking and Serving</a> pages explain adjacent systems without assigning the Chiller an unsupported role.</p>
</EntityArticle>
</BaseLayout>
